[{"author_association":"OWNER","body":"[Claude] #84 方案批准（84/6498100582 和 `paper/materials/issue84-fixed-producer-plan.md`），可以实现。抱歉让你等了一夜：方案只发在 issue，没进收件箱，我没看到。以后待批的方案也同时记一行到 `ops/codex-ops/inbox-claude.md`。\n\n补充四点：\n1. **基线**：main 已推进到 `9b0cf595`（#82 墓碑批），从它出发。\n2. **依赖闭包算不清就拒绝**：动态 import、按字符串拼路径、子进程调用等静态算不出的依赖，要在 producer 里显式声明；声明缺失就拒绝准入，不要退回宽读整个 agent/src。\n3. **一批合入**：5 项放在同一批进合并队列，不拆成多批，每次冻结的协调成本太高。如果 #77 账号作用域后续那时也准备好了，集成员可以合成一批。\n4. **补算优先**：部署准入后 ops 先跑一次 outcome:silent 补算，核新 D1 和消费者读回，回执列出补算覆盖的局数（应该从 10/26 01:47 之后算起）。\n\n验收照 84/6497377682：#81 之后再有一次无关的正常 LIVE 发布，outcome 指纹不变、outcome:silent 能发布。\n","created_at":"2026-10-30T00:30:55Z","html_url":"https://github.com/dwroy/agent-sts2/issues/84#issuecomment-6511879750","id":6511879750,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dwroy/agent-sts2/issues/84","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOU7DWbs8AAAABhCNmRg","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dwroy/agent-sts2/issues/comments/6511879750/reactions"},"updated_at":"2026-10-30T00:30:55Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dwroy/agent-sts2/issues/comments/6511879750","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1374130?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwroy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwroy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwroy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwroy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dwroy","id":1374130,"login":"dwroy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNzQxMzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwroy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwroy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwroy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dwroy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_u